Package: yuos-base
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Yu OS <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/xiaoyu-work/Yu-OS
XB-YuOS-Security-Epoch: __SECURITY_EPOCH__
XB-YuOS-Abi: __ABI__
Depends: yuos-framework (>= __MIN_FRAMEWORK__), yuos-abi-__ABI__,
 systemd, systemd-coredump,
 init-system-helpers (>= 1.52), python3
Description: Yu OS distribution integration layer
 Extends `yuos-framework` with the recovery helper, managed OverlayFS
 agent home, boot/service policies, and device-specific Linux workarounds
 used by Yu OS images and installed systems.
 .
 This package is not required on Debian or Ubuntu hosts that only want
 the reusable Framework or system Agent. It deliberately owns no runtime,
 headless app, browser, branding, launcher, or desktop files.
